    "intent": "The Blackscales: Brackwater's hostile lizardfolk tribe, who've thrown in with the goblins. Their tokens are darkened from the lizardfolk sets so they read apart from the friendly Reedtalkers (green, NCUs). Their war-leader and L2's boss, in its lair deep in the mire, guarded by warriors and a shaman.",
    "balance": "A quest boss, tuned by hand: 1.5x a solo's HP (450). Below half health it enrages (Swamp Fury) and starts Bog Wave, so a player should save cooldowns for the second phase."
